WEBVTT

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:29.710
Sanshuu Middle School's Hero Club is a
club that aims to make people happy.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.720
"Try not to give up!"

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.030
"You're likely to succeed if you try!"

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.220
These are some of the things we try our best to live by.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.180
Today the Hero Club takes off again!

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.890
What's that, an elementary
schooler's essay?

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:47.360
I'm a middle-schooler.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.810
Yeah. I know.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:53.190
Yuuna, the town magazine is going to do a write-up about the stuff the Hero Club does,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:55.530
so try to come up with something catchy, okay?

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.680
Okay!

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.410
Onee-chan, we got a lot of thank-you
mail from the kindergarten class!

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.290
It's amazing! Amazing!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.850
Well, our last performance <i>was</i>
pretty explosive, after all.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.800
The parents were smiling bitterly, though...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:10.100
That's not true at all!

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.010
Sorry, sorry! Have you already started?

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:18.160
I fell asleep in the middle
of my cleaning duty.

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:24.180
Sonoko, you're probably the only one who
could fall asleep in a situation like that...

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.720
Ah, she praised me!

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.000
Good for you!

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.760
Karin-chan hardly ever
compliments people.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:31.900
Yay!

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.420
I wasn't complimenting her!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.930
NIBOSSHI!

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:36.530
That's got nothing to do with this.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.660
Okay, is everybody here?

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:43.540
Now, let's discuss our club
activities for December.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.950
Okay!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.640
First up, I put the new requests on the map...

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.170
<i>A lot of things happened before autumn,</i>

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:56.380
<i>but Sanshuu Middle School's Hero Club
is doing as great as ever!</i>

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.270
"Zero is nothing".

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:13.640
To be able to create such a concept, the Indians
must have been pretty amazing people! Yoga! Yoga!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:18.800
Erm, that's fine and all, but can we do something I could
actually <i>use</i> in the high school entrance exams.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.940
Why is Sonoko-san, a second year,
teaching you, Onee-chan?

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:25.440
Yay! Sweet dumplings!

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.120
Nogi's smarter than any of the
private tutors around here!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.360
Though she doesn't look like it...

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.890
Eh? Then maybe she could
help me study, too!

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:39.840
Ah, that's a good idea!
You're worrying me a bit, after all.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:44.720
A lot of things happened, so I wasn't
able to study during the summer.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.930
But your grades were pretty good
until your second year, right?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.690
They were unreasonably good back then,

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.310
but now they're just unreasonable!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.610
House!

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:55.070
Onee-chan...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.860
B-But I can't help it...

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:01.280
A lot of things happened since
I became a third year...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:09.290
Fuumin-senpai, we're here right now
because you did your best.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.290
I'm Nogi Sonoko, and I'm here
to join the Hero Club!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:16.210
Eh? Nogi Sonoko? The real deal?!

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:20.300
The Hero 'round the Great Seto
Bridge two years ago, you know!

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:24.260
Once again, it's nice to meet you!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.810
Ah!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:29.850
Why is the legendary Hero in here?

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:33.330
Hmmm... because I had nothing
better to do at home?

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.780
For that reason?

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.700
I dropped out of grade school!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.110
She said it just like that!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:45.830
Now that she's been relieved from her duty, she asked the Taisha if she could go back to living a normal life.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:50.060
I thought I'd never be able to
go back to living normally.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.820
Yes, indeed.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:54.710
<i>O-Our legendary senpai is pretty weird...</i>

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.500
We welcome the great Hero of the
previous generation, Nogi-san.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.440
Just call me either Nogi or
Sonoko, Fuumin-senpai!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.300
F-Fu...?

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.760
Nice to meet you, Nibosshi!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.640
Who's the one who told her that?!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.680
Itsuki-chan is "Ittsun".

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.940
Eh? Ittsun?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:15.360
And Yuuna-chan could be "Yuuyu".

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:16.860
Ah, that's wonderful!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.880
Well, then I'll call you Sono-chan!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.740
Oh, please do!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.940
Ah, this is Sancho!

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:28.630
Nice to meet you!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:31.080
She's a strange person, isn't she?

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:36.920
I see. So this is how you girls have
been enjoying your youth.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:38.790
Sono-chan!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:39.670
Hm?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.420
Welcome to the Hero Club!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.290
Yeah!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.930
Now I can enjoy my youth, too!

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:48.820
I'll do my best! Yeah!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.720
I was always watching from my bed...

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.690
"The Hero Club looks fun."

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.900
"I bet they're enjoying it."

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:01.750
I never thought I'd be able
to attend school again.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.530
I'm happy.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.260
Okay! Now back to studying!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.600
Let's start with my favorite complex matrix. A complex number is...

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.540
I don't get it... I don't understand...

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:21.170
Karin-chan, thanks for coming,
even though it's a Sunday!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.470
It's nothing. I just happened
to be free this time.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.720
It's just a coincidence.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:30.890
Yeah! But you were really cool
back there, Karin-chan!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.570
You weren't half-bad either.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.530
Strike!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.360
Ehehe! Thanks!

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.920
The Hero Club is weird, isn't it?

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:54.060
That's what makes it fun!
You get to do different things every day.

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.570
Well, that's true.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.300
The sun sets, and tomorrow's a new day!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:08.770
Aw, it'll be Monday already, huh?
Time sure flies on our days off.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:11.050
We have to do our homework
after we get home, huh?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.910
I already did mine, though.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.610
Eh? But we were busy with
the match since morning!

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:18.520
I had it finished by Saturday, of course.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.270
You're amazing, Karin-chan!

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.450
What's wrong?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.000
No, it's nothing...

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.920
Ta-da!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.790
Ah! A cake! How did
you sneak that in?

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.580
We had home economics today.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.270
I didn't think of that.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:53.010
Itsuki-chan, did you make it?

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.120
Yes!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.760
I made too much,
so I brought some!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:02.110
Amazing, my little sister!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.880
Her taste is pretty unique...

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.320
You could say that she's expressive!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.820
Now, dig in, dig in!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.520
How is it?

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.120
Looks aside...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.870
It's good!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.670
Miss, you're a pro!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.560
Itsuki finally made something edible!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.260
Onee-chan, that actually kinda stings...

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.800
Ittsun, Ittsun! Let's set up a shop!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.580
We could even turn
it into a franchise!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:39.020
Sonoko-san, your ambitions are so high,
I can't tell if you're joking or not...

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.750
But, thank you!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.020
I could eat this forever!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.000
Ah! You can have it, Karin-chan!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:54.120
No, no! Itsuki should
be the one to eat it!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:58.660
Ah, I already ate some in class.
Sonoko-san, you can have it.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.630
Prez, you can have it.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:03.920
Eating two would make me a bit
worried about my girl power.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:07.010
Why did you even cut it into
six in the first place, Fuu?

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:10.040
Don't ask me! It's out of habit!

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:10.970
Habit?

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:15.680
Eh? Ah... just a feeling, perhaps?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.180
I've cut it into five pieces!

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.490
Ah...

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.500
How were you able to cut it like this?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.940
Mathematics!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.260
Amazing!

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:25.440
You're amazing!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.310
Botamochi.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.200
Hm? What?

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.570
I just had a feeling that we've eaten
botamochi in the club room before...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:37.830
Ah! Didn't you make some for home
economics class before, Yuuna-san?

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.630
Eh? Ah, that's right!

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:45.290
Now, snack time's over.
Time to practice for Sunday!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.760
Okay!

00:09:55.550 --> 00:10:00.100
Mino-san, I finally got the
chance to visit you.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:02.660
It's been a while.
How have you been doing?

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.620
Ah, I guess that wasn't
the right question.

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:11.920
Speaking of "a while", the Shoyumame
gelato shop at Ines isn't open anymore.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:16.920
It's a shame.
The flow of time is cruel.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:24.190
By the way, Mino-san. I joined the Hero Club.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.930
Yep! The one from Sanshuu Middle School.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:33.940
Everyone is really interesting.
They're a lot like our team was.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:38.700
Today is Saturday, and we're all performing
in a play for the kindergartners.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.320
I'll do my best in my role as a tree!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.950
Be sure to watch, okay?

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:49.700
Oh, right. I made this at home.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:54.460
I remembered how you cooked it
and tried to make it myself.

00:10:55.820 --> 00:11:00.220
This is for you. Do tell me if it's delicious.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:04.430
This is for me. And...

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:12.620
I wonder why I made three, Mino-san?

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.220
Nogi isn't here yet?

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:41.240
But we're already about to start...

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:45.470
She hasn't read her messages.
Is she still asleep?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:49.180
Sonoko-san was pretty excited
about this, though.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.130
Even though her role is only a "tree"...

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.350
We don't have a choice.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.640
I guess we'll have to go
without the tree for today.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:58.600
Yuuna?

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:00.820
Ah, yeah.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:04.520
Hey! You too, Yuuna?
The show's about to start.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:06.740
Are you not feeling well?

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.950
I'm fine...

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:12.040
Uhm, you know?

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.540
Hmm? What's wrong?

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:18.800
I feel kind of restless.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.550
Don't you?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.000
Yuuna-san?

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:29.120
Should we call it off for today?

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.100
Hero Club members?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.530
Thank you so much for today.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.060
Ah, actually...

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:38.230
The children are really
excited about the play!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.710
They can't wait for it to start.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.450
It's all right!

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.320
Let's do it! Everyone's waiting!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:51.690
Hey! Hey! I am the super
evil Demon King!

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:56.790
I've come today to take those who don't
listen to their teachers with me!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:03.420
Join me and let's do whatever we want!
There's no need to hold yourself back!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.380
Stop right there, Demon King!

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.520
Leave those children out
of your evil schemes!

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.510
Who said you could speak, conceited brat!

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.140
Hey!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:19.980
No matter how badly the Hero
was hurt, she never gave up.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:26.990
Because, if everyone gave up, then the world
would truly be engulfed in darkness.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.490
One by one they fell to the Demon King...

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:34.500
And by the time she realized it,
the Hero found herself alone.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:39.250
No one knew that the Hero was alone.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:49.850
Even when she was alone, the Hero...

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.310
Yuuna?

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:57.560
Even so, the Hero...

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:05.820
...believed that there was hope,
as long as she didn't give up.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:11.920
No matter what she lost...
No matter what...

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:24.590
No matter what... I don't want to lose
my most precious friend!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.760
She's crying...

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.950
Yuuna-san...

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:42.860
Nogi?

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.720
I...

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.120
I said...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:59.120
I said... I'd be by her side forever!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.980
I promised...

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:03.820
And yet...

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.320
Yuuna-san...

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.850
Sonoko, you too?

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:17.180
What happened to you two?

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:19.430
Listen closely, okay?

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.690
Yeah...

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.190
Our current memories are fake.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.480
Eh?

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:37.370
Something unbelievably bad happened, and for some reason,
we've been made to think it never did.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:42.300
What are you talking about? Hey, Yuuna?

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:44.810
I... remembered.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:45.750
Hold on...

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:52.760
I had another really important
friend in the Hero Club.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.830
There's no way I could forget...

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.520
I shouldn't have forgotten.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.730
But why did I?

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.420
Yuuna, calm down.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.520
Remember her!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.830
Tougou-san...

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:11.990
There used to be a girl named
Tougou Mimori here!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:17.740
Oh, right. Where <i>is</i> Tougou right now?

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.870
Tougou...

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:31.460
Tougou Mimori...

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:40.700
Right?

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.240
Ta-da-daah!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.740
It's Sonoko from the Nogi family!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:49.900
Surprised?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.050
Eh?

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:54.560
Eh? Ah... Um... Uh... Wha-

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:58.480
We'll be in the same class starting today!

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:00.040
Treat me well, okay!

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.790
Sonocchi?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.600
Hey! Hey! Wasshi! It's Sonoko!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.250
Sonocchi...

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.560
You really <i>are</i> surprised! I nailed it!

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.510
Sonocchi!
You really <i>are</i> surprised! I nailed it!

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.380
Whoa! Wait a sec... Wasshi!

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:22.020
I'm Nogi Sonoko, and I'm here
to join the Hero Club!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:24.060
What? Nogi Sonoko...

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.690
The Hero 'round the Great Seto
Bridge two years ago, you know!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.440
Once again, it's nice to meet you!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.820
I can't believe we can
study together again.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.120
Wake me up if I fall asleep
during class, okay?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.570
You should take care not to
fall asleep in the first place.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:43.650
Tougou, you're acting
like her mother.

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:44.710
Oh.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:46.960
The Wheel of Fortune.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.200
Ooh, that sounds cool.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:50.690
What does it mean?

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:53.730
A fateful encounter!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:56.090
I'm a fateful girl!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.550
Fortune!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.920
H-Happiness and prosperity!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:04.060
It can also mean an inevitable, grave situation, though...

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.520
Hmm...

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.310
What's wrong, Itsuki?

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.740
You're making a really scary face.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.560
Kokubou Kamen.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:14.410
What?

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:18.090
A mysterious hero who's the
talk of the town right now.

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:19.870
We have someone like that?

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:23.330
The people call me to defend the country!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.120
They shout for me to defend love!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.790
The warrior of patriotism, Kokubou Kamen has arrived!

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.790
See?

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.550
Someone help!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:37.920
Stop right there!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.180
The people call me to
defend the country!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.810
They shout for me to defend love!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:50.350
The warrior of patriotism,
Kokubou Kamen, has arrived!

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.220
Captured!

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.270
How did you!?

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.500
I am Kokubou Kamen.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:59.670
When the people are threatened by evil,
I will appear when I can.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.110
When you can?

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.490
Hold it.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:05.790
I found you, Tougou.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.500
I don't even know where to start here...

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:15.050
Did Kokubou Kamen-san
really visit us?

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:16.620
Yuuna-san?

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:20.550
Thank you very much for helping me
when I was in danger the other day!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.590
What happened there?
Can we shake hands? Please! I'm your big fan!

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:25.310
Apparently Kokubou Kamen-san helped her look for her wallet...

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:25.320
Can we shake hands? Please! I'm your big fan!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.890
when she dropped it on the street that night.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.560
Huh...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:34.420
Kokubou Kamen-san, you're really
easy to talk to. I wonder why?

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.070
Well, I wonder...

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.280
So, why did you come to
the Hero Club today?

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.800
That's because...

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.960
I am Kokubou Kamen, Yuuna-chan!

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.540
Everyone knew.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:51.710
No way...

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.630
Kokubou Kamen-san was
Tougou-san all along?!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.130
She's serious, isn't she?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:59.800
So what did you mean
by being very sorry?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:05.460
After my body recovered,
I just couldn't sit still.

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.270
Why?

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:11.770
Because I broke the wall.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:17.770
It was an impulsive decision, but that doesn't
change the fact I put the world in danger.

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.360
That was something inexcusable.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:31.870
So I have been looking for a way to make up for what I've done - a way to atone for my sins.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.160
And that's why you've been dressing
up as Kokubou Kamen.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:37.340
Wasshi! You've become pretty
radical, haven't you?!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:40.450
I understand you. However,
you got <i>too</i> much into it.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:41.880
I'm sorry.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:45.590
Kokubou Kamen is really cool!
Can I be one too?

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.260
Eh?

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:51.100
You know, I might not look like it, but I'm
actually Kokubou Kamen number two!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.300
I'll be number three then!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:55.400
We don't need any more!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.650
That's right.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:59.110
I'll spread the greatness of dried sardines across the world!
What if Karin starts imitating you and we get Niboshi Kamen?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.530
Niboshi Kamen has arrived!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.150
I won't!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.400
Tougou-san,

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:08.600
we all want to do our best
to help people, too.

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.480
That's right, Wasshi.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:13.750
If anything happens,
you can just rely on us!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.650
Yuuna-chan... Sonocchi...

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:19.090
Yep. They're right.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:21.050
Tougou-san.

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:26.710
Everyone... Thank you.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.060
What's this all about?

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:36.660
What is this?

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.180
How?

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:43.630
Why didn't anyone of us
remember Tougou?

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:49.540
It's as if she never existed in
this world in the first place!

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.990
Onee-chan.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.710
I'm the club president...

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.250
And yet again, I...

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:01.160
But we remembered now.

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:04.670
But why? What's going on?

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.090
Wasshi...

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:11.650
Where are you?
What are you doing?
